const roles=[['retention','保留评分','判断安全移出'],['capsule','胶囊摘要','细化衍生证据'],['chain','链关联','辅助模糊关联']];
function Models({scopeId}:{scopeId:string}) {
  const settings=useRequest('settings',{}),[role,setRole]=useState('retention'),[draft,setDraft]=useState<Data[]|null>(null),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[message,setMessage]=useState(''),[error,setError]=useState(''),[test,setTest]=useState<Data|null>(null),[callStatus,setCallStatus]=useState(''),[callRole,setCallRole]=useState(''),[callProvider,setCallProvider]=useState(''),[cursor,setCursor]=useState<string|undefined>(),[previous,setPrevious]=useState<(string|undefined)[]>([]);
  const calls=useRequest('list',{scopeId,kind:'providers',limit:50,...(cursor?{cursor}:{}),...(callStatus?{status:callStatus}:{}),...(callRole?{role:callRole}:{}),...(callProvider?{provider:callProvider}:{})},true);
  useEffect(()=>{setDraft(null);setMessage('');setError('');},[role]);
  useEffect(()=>{if(draft)setError('');},[draft]);
  const providers=draft??settings.data?.providers?.[role]??[];
  const edit=(index:number,patch:Data)=>setDraft(providers.map((p:Data,i:number)=>i===index?{...p,...patch}:p));
  const save=async()=>{setBusy(true);setError('');setMessage('');try{const clean=providers.map((p:Data)=>{const out:Data={name:p.name,kind:p.kind,model:p.model,keyAction:p.keyAction??'keep'};for(const k of ['baseUrl','reasoningEffort'])if(p[k])out[k]=p[k];if(p.apiKeyEnv!==undefined)out.apiKeyEnv=p.apiKeyEnv;if(p.keyAction==='replace')out.newKey=p.newKey??'';return out;});const result=await command('saveSettings',{expectedRevision:settings.data?.revision,patch:{providers:{[role]:clean},...(role==='retention'&&clean.length?{retention:{scorer:clean.every((p:Data)=>p.kind==='systemone')?'systemone':settings.data?.retention?.scorer==='systemone'?'jev':settings.data?.retention?.scorer??'jev'}}:{})}});setDraft(null);setMessage(`配置已保存。${result.reloadRequired?'其他宿主需重载才能采用。':result.adopted?'面板进程已采用；其他宿主仍需重载。':'面板采用状态尚未确认；其他宿主仍需重载。'}${result.warning?.message?` ${result.warning.message}`:''}`);await settings.load();}catch(e){setError(errorText(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}};
  const testProvider=async(name:string)=>{setBusy(true);setError('');setTest(null);try{setTest(await command('testProvider',{role,name,expectedRevision:settings.data?.revision}));await calls.load();}catch(e){setError(errorText(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}};
  return <><Alert>模型配置和调用账本属于<strong>整个选定存储</strong>。记录的 token 可能缺失；cost=0 是未定价占位，不能作为实际花费或免费请求。</Alert><ModelStatus scopeId={scopeId}/><Card title="模型角色" aside={<Badge>全存储配置</Badge>}><RequestState {...settings} retry={()=>void settings.load()}/><div className="role-tabs">{roles.map(([id,name,description])=><button key={id} className={role===id?'active':''} onClick={()=>setRole(id)}><strong>{name}</strong><small>{description} · {id}</small></button>)}</div>{error&&<Alert tone="error">{error} <button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{setDraft(null);void settings.load();}}>重载配置</button></Alert>}{message&&<Alert tone="success">{message}</Alert>}<div className="provider-list">{providers.map((p:Data,i:number)=><div className="provider-card" key={i}><div className="card-heading"><h3>#{i+1} {p.name||'新 Provider'}</h3><div className="inline-actions"><Badge>{p.keyConfigured?'凭据已配置':p.apiKeyEnv?'环境变量凭据':'未配置凭据'}</Badge><button title="向前移动" disabled={i===0||busy} onClick={()=>{const next=[...providers];[next[i-1],next[i]]=[next[i],next[i-1]];setDraft(next);}}>↑</button><button disabled={busy} onClick={()=>setDraft(providers.filter((_:Data,j:number)=>i!==j))}>移除</button></div></div><div className="form-grid"><Field label="名称" value={p.name??''} onChange={v=>edit(i,{name:v})}/><label>类型<select value={p.kind??'openai-compatible'} onChange={e=>edit(i,{kind:e.target.value,reasoningEffort:undefined})}>{['openai-compatible','anthropic','gemini',...(role==='retention'?['systemone']:[]),'fake'].map(k=><option key={k}>{k}</option>)}</select></label><Field label="模型" value={p.model??''} onChange={v=>edit(i,{model:v})}/><Field label="Base URL" value={p.baseUrl??''} placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1" onChange={v=>edit(i,{baseUrl:v})}/><Field label="API Key 环境变量" value={p.apiKeyEnv??''} onChange={v=>edit(i,{apiKeyEnv:v})}/>{p.kind==='openai-compatible'&&<label>Reasoning effort<select value={p.reasoningEffort??''} onChange={e=>edit(i,{reasoningEffort:e.target.value})}><option value="">使用模型默认</option>{['none','low','medium','high','max'].map(v=><option key={v}>{v}</option>)}</select></label>}<label>本地配置中的 Key<select value={p.keyAction??'keep'} onChange={e=>edit(i,{keyAction:e.target.value,newKey:''})}><option value="keep">保持原 Key</option><option value="replace">替换 Key</option><option value="delete">删除配置中的 Key</option></select></label>{p.keyAction==='replace'&&<Field label="新 Key · 只写不回显" type="password" value={p.newKey??''} autoComplete="new-password" onChange={v=>edit(i,{newKey:v})}/>}</div><div className="provider-bottom"><span>凭据来源：{keySources[p.keySource]??'尚未保存'} · 手动远程测试可能计费</span><button disabled={busy||!!draft} onClick={()=>void testProvider(p.name)}>手动模型测试</button></div></div>)}</div>{settings.data&&!providers.length&&<Empty title="此角色尚未配置模型">本地归档和检索不需要模型。可按需要配置本地或远程 Provider。</Empty>}<div className="form-actions"><button disabled={busy||!settings.data||providers.length>=8} onClick={()=>setDraft([...providers,{name:'',kind:'openai-compatible',model:'',baseUrl:'',keyAction:'keep'}])}>＋ 添加 Provider</button><button disabled={!draft||busy} onClick={()=>setDraft(null)}>放弃修改</button><button className="primary" disabled={!draft||busy} onClick={()=>void save()}>{busy?'处理中…':'保存此角色配置'}</button></div><p className="card-note">按顺序尝试 Provider。systemone 仅用于 retention，保存时同步采用 systemone 评分器；同一 retention 列表请勿混用 native 与普通 Provider。修改已有 Provider 名称后，需重新配置对应凭据。测试使用已保存配置和固定合成输入，远程请求可能计费；页面打开和轮询不会自动测试。</p>{test&&<div className="test-result"><h3>手动测试结果</h3><Facts data={test}/></div>}</Card>
    <Card title="Provider 调用账本" aside={<Badge>全存储 · 非项目统计</Badge>}><div className="filters"><Filter label="调用结果" value={callStatus} set={v=>{setCallStatus(v);setCursor(undefined);setPrevious([]);}} options={[['ok','成功'],['error','失败']]}/><Filter label="调用角色" value={callRole} set={v=>{setCallRole(v);setCursor(undefined);setPrevious([]);}} options={roles.map(([id,name])=>[id,name])}/><input aria-label="Provider 名称筛选" placeholder="Provider 名称" value={callProvider} onChange={e=>{setCallProvider(e.target.value);setCursor(undefined);setPrevious([]);}}/><button onClick={()=>void calls.load()}>↻ 刷新</button></div><RequestState {...calls} retry={()=>void calls.load()}/><div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>角色 / Provider</th><th>模型</th><th>状态</th><th>记录的输入 / 输出 token</th><th>耗时</th></tr></thead><tbody>{calls.data?.items?.map((c:Data,i:number)=><tr key={c.id??i}><td>{time(c.createdAt??c.created_at)}</td><td><strong>{c.purpose??c.role}</strong><small>{c.provider??c.provider_name??c.providerName}</small></td><td>{c.model}</td><td><Badge tone={c.ok===false||c.ok===0||c.success===false||c.success===0||c.status==='error'||c.state==='stale'||c.state==='stopped'?'danger':'neutral'}>{c.status??(c.ok??c.success?'成功':'失败')}</Badge></td><td>{number(c.tokensIn??c.inputTokens??c.input_tokens)} / {number(c.tokensOut??c.outputTokens??c.output_tokens)}</td><td>{c.latencyMs!==undefined||c.latency_ms!==undefined?`${number(c.latencyMs??c.latency_ms)} ms`:'未记录'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>{!calls.loading&&calls.data&&!calls.data.items?.length&&<Empty title="暂无调用记录">账本记录整个存储的模型调用；尚未发生任何调用。</Empty>}<Pagination previous={previous} setPrevious={setPrevious} cursor={cursor} setCursor={setCursor} next={calls.data?.nextCursor} loading={calls.loading}/></Card></>;
}
function Field({label,value:v,onChange,type='text',placeholder,autoComplete}:{label:string;value:string;onChange:(v:string)=>void;type?:string;placeholder?:string;autoComplete?:string}) {return <label>{label}<input value={v} type={type} placeholder={placeholder} autoComplete={autoComplete} onChange={e=>onChange(e.target.value)}/></label>;}

function Settings() {
  const request=useRequest('settings',{}),[draft,setDraft]=useState<Data>({}),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(''),[message,setMessage]=useState('');
  const config=request.data??{},integration={...config.integration,...draft.integration},strategy=draft.strategy??config.strategy;
  const patchIntegration=(patch:Data)=>setDraft({...draft,integration:{...draft.integration,...patch}});
  useEffect(()=>{if(Object.keys(draft).length)setError('');},[draft]);
  const save=async()=>{setBusy(true);setError('');setMessage('');try{const result=await command('saveSettings',{expectedRevision:config.revision,patch:draft});setDraft({});await request.load();setMessage(`配置已写入选定存储。面板配置已刷新；${result.reloadRequired?'已有宿主进程需重载。':'其他宿主的采用情况仍需单独检查。'}${result.warning?.message?` ${result.warning.message}`:''}`);}catch(e){setError(errorText(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}};
  return <><Alert>策略作用于<strong>整个选定存储</strong>，顶部证据范围不会限制配置影响。保存配置、面板采用和宿主采用分别判断。</Alert><Card title="保留策略" aside={<Badge>全存储配置</Badge>}><RequestState {...request} retry={()=>void request.load()}/>{error&&<Alert tone="error">{error} <button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{setDraft({});void request.load();}}>放弃草稿并重载</button></Alert>}{message&&<Alert tone="success">{message}</Alert>}<div className="strategy-cards">{[['conservative','保守','更久保留原始工作上下文'],['balanced','平衡','按压力与保护条件发布'],['aggressive','积极','更早考虑候选历史视图']].map(([id,name,description])=><button className={strategy===id?'active':''} key={id} onClick={()=>setDraft({...draft,strategy:id})}><span className="strategy-radio"/><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p><small>{config.strategies?.[id]?`触发 ${Math.round(config.strategies[id].trigger*100)}% · 目标 ${Math.round(config.strategies[id].release*100)}%`:'读取预设中'}</small></button>)}</div><p className="card-note">阈值是策略输入与估算，不是实际 Provider tokenizer 用量；保护条件可能阻止达到目标。</p><div className="settings-rows"><Toggle title="仅捕获模式" description="保留归档与检索，停止新增投影。不会停止宿主工具捕获。" checked={!!integration.captureOnly} onChange={v=>patchIntegration({captureOnly:v})}/><Toggle title="入口投影" description="仅适用于支持且已明确启用的 Claude / MCP 路径。默认关闭。" checked={!!integration.ingressCompression} onChange={v=>patchIntegration({ingressCompression:v})}/></div><div className="form-grid"><label>保留评分器<select value={draft.retention?.scorer??config.retention?.scorer??'jev'} onChange={e=>setDraft({...draft,retention:{scorer:e.target.value}})}><option value="jev">jev · 当前评分</option><option value="conservative">conservative · 保守评分</option><option value="systemone">systemone · Native Clef</option></select></label>{[['contextWindow','上下文窗口估算'],['maxOutputChars','最大候选输出字符'],['minHistorySavingsChars','最小批次减少字符'],['historyCooldownTurns','批次间隔轮次']].map(([k,label])=><label key={k}>{label}<input type="number" min={k==='historyCooldownTurns'?0:1} value={integration[k]??''} onChange={e=>patchIntegration({[k]:Number(e.target.value)})}/></label>)}</div><div className="form-actions"><span className="muted">配置 revision {short(config.revision)}</span><button disabled={!Object.keys(draft).length||busy} onClick={()=>setDraft({})}>放弃修改</button><button className="primary" disabled={!Object.keys(draft).length||busy||!request.data} onClick={()=>void save()}>{busy?'保存中…':'保存策略'}</button></div></Card>
    <Card title="宿主能力边界"><div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>宿主</th><th>Native 捕获</th><th>历史 / 入口候选视图</th><th>接入说明</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[['Codex','支持','Native 不支持','Hook 信任与会话重载单独验证'],['Kimi Code','支持','Native 不支持','截断结果保持 partial'],['OpenCode','支持（1.x / 2.x）','历史投影','2.x 已在短合成会话实测；1.x 尚未实测'],['Claude Code','支持','明确启用后可用入口投影','只支持成功 Bash stdout 形状'],['MCP proxy','符合条件的工具','只读纯文本工具明确启用','上游调用仅转发一次']].map(([host,capture,projection,note])=><tr key={host}><td><strong>{host}</strong></td><td>{capture}</td><td>{projection}</td><td>{note}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><Alert>能力表不是当前安装、授信或 live smoke 的认证。看板不自动授信，也不改变宿主 sandbox。当前范围的接入文件检查见“诊断”页。</Alert></Card><Card title="存储与保留"><Facts data={config.storage}/>{config.adoption&&<><h4>配置保存与采用状态</h4><Facts data={config.adoption}/></>}<p className="card-note">默认无删除期限。此面板不执行 GC、备份恢复或自动清理；逻辑载荷与实际磁盘占用分开。</p></Card></>;
}
function Toggle({title,description,checked,onChange}:{title:string;description:string;checked:boolean;onChange:(v:boolean)=>void}) {return <label className="toggle-row"><div><strong>{title}</strong><p>{description}</p></div><input className="switch" type="checkbox" checked={checked} onChange={e=>onChange(e.target.checked)}/></label>;}

function Diagnostics({scopeId}:{scopeId:string}) {
  const diagnostic=useRequest('diagnostics',{scopeId},!!scopeId),jobs=useRequest('jobs',{scopeId},!!scopeId),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(''),[message,setMessage]=useState('');
  const jobList=jobs.data?.jobs??[],running=jobList.some((j:Data)=>['queued','running','cancelling','pending'].includes(j.status));
  // Poll only while a job is active; background polls are silent and back off while the service is unreachable.
  useEffect(()=>{if(!scopeId||!running)return;let alive=true,failures=0,timer:ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>;const next=()=>{timer=setTimeout(async()=>{const ok=await jobs.load(true);if(!alive)return;failures=ok?0:failures+1;next();},document.hidden?10000:Math.min(30000,2000*Math.pow(2,failures)));};next();return()=>{alive=false;clearTimeout(timer);};},[scopeId,running,jobs.load]);
  const start=async(reindex:boolean)=>{setBusy(true);setError('');setMessage('');try{const job=await command('startJob',{scopeId,reindex});setMessage(`已创建${reindex?'索引重建':'完整性校验'}任务 ${short(job.id)}。刷新页面不会重复提交。`);}catch(e){setError(errorText(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}await jobs.load(true);};
  const cancel=async(id:string)=>{setBusy(true);setError('');try{await command('cancelJob',{scopeId,id});}catch(e){setError(errorText(e));}finally{setBusy(false);}await jobs.load(true);};
  const copy=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(JSON.stringify(diagnostic.data,null,2));setMessage('已复制脱敏诊断摘要。');}catch{setError('复制失败，可展开结构化摘要手动复制。');}};
  return <><Alert>维护只在手动触发后运行。取消在安全批次边界生效，正在执行的 SQLite 操作可能继续完成；服务重启不会自动重放。</Alert>{error&&<Alert tone="error">{error}</Alert>}{message&&<Alert tone="success">{message}</Alert>}<div className="two-columns"><Card title="环境与健康" aside={<button className="text-button" onClick={()=>void diagnostic.load()}>↻ 刷新</button>}><RequestState {...diagnostic} retry={()=>void diagnostic.load()}/><Facts data={diagnostic.data?.environment??diagnostic.data?.health??{}}/><JsonPanel data={diagnostic.data} label="脱敏诊断摘要"/><button disabled={!diagnostic.data} onClick={()=>void copy()}>复制脱敏摘要</button></Card><Card title="手动维护"><div className="maintenance-option"><span>◈</span><div><h3>原文与回执完整性</h3><p>检查捕获字节、SHA-256 和已存在回执；不推定上游完整性。</p><button className="primary" disabled={busy||!scopeId||running} onClick={()=>void start(false)}>开始校验</button></div></div><div className="maintenance-option"><span>▤</span><div><h3>重建搜索索引</h3><p>为当前范围的原文重建派生索引。原文字节与来源保持独立。</p><button disabled={busy||!scopeId||running} onClick={()=>void start(true)}>开始重建索引</button></div></div></Card></div><Card title="维护任务" aside={<Badge>当前服务运行期</Badge>}><RequestState {...jobs} retry={()=>void jobs.load()}/>{jobList.length?<div className="job-list">{jobList.map((j:Data)=><div className="job-card" key={j.id}><div className="card-heading"><h3>{j.kind??j.type??(j.reindex?'索引重建':'完整性校验')} <code>{short(j.id)}</code></h3><div className="inline-actions"><Badge tone={j.status==='failed'?'danger':j.status==='completed'?'success':'neutral'}>{stateLabel(j.status)}</Badge>{['queued','running','cancelling','pending'].includes(j.status)&&<button disabled={busy||j.status==='cancelling'} onClick={()=>void cancel(j.id)}>请求取消</button>}</div></div><div className="job-progress"><progress max={j.total??j.progress?.total??100} value={j.completed??j.checked??j.progress?.completed??j.progress?.checked??0}/><span>{number(j.completed??j.checked??j.progress?.completed??j.progress?.checked)} / {number(j.total??j.progress?.total)}</span></div><p className="muted">开始 {time(j.startedAt??j.createdAt)} · 完成 {time(j.finishedAt??j.completedAt)}</p>{j.result&&<Facts data={j.result}/>} {j.error&&<Alert tone="error">{value(j.error)}</Alert>}<JsonPanel data={j} label="任务状态详情"/></div>)}</div>:<Empty title="尚无维护任务">原文校验和重建索引不会由看板轮询自动执行。</Empty>}</Card></>;
}
